.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></button></div></div></h1><p>Self-refineme=
nt is an inference-time scaling strategy in which a model improves its own =
answers through one or more revision cycles. I=E2=80=99d say today this is =
probably the prototypical example of inference scaling in reasoning models,=
 i.e., the first method that intuitively comes to mind when talking about i=
mproving reasoning model results.</p><p>The idea is that instead of relying=
