raft pc-reset header-anchor offset-top"></div><button type=3D"button" aria-=
label=3D"Link" data-href=3D"https://magazine.sebastianraschka.com/i/1802870=
77/71-search-over-solution-paths-papers-2025" class=3D"pencraft pc-reset pe=
ncraft iconButton-mq_Et5 iconButtonBase-dJGHgN buttonBase-GK1x3M buttonStyl=
e-r7yGCK size_sm-G3LciD priority_secondary-S63h9o" tabindex=3D"0"><svg xmln=
