<p>We can all agree that the main deployed LLMs use some sort of inference =
scaling. E.g., as discussed at the beginning of this article, the accuracy =
improvements due to inference scaling were specifically highlighted in the =
o1 reasoning model release in OpenAI=E2=80=99s blog post.</p><p>Unfortunate=
ly, it=E2=80=99s hard to say what exactly OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, xAI, e=
tc., use in their platforms. However, based on publicly available informati=
on, it may be worth speculating a bit.</p><h2 class=3D"header-anchor-post">=
<strong>9.1 Chain-of-Thought</strong><div class=3D"pencraft pc-display-flex=
